[2026-09-20 12:21:27 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 118]   longitude without a compact dipole;
[2026-09-20 12:21:27 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 118]   H3  look-elsewhere fluctuation -- the rotated control caught a ~2.5
[2026-09-20 12:21:27 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 118]   sigma excursion of a field with no coherent structure.
